WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:02,430
I haven’t been to another hell since the beginning of spring.

2
00:00:02,430 --> 00:00:04,590
Our base is out of food and so are we.

3
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:05,790
Fifteen people support each other

4
00:00:05,790 --> 00:00:07,430
You all make a commitment to each other

5
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:08,590
Daweiba

6
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:09,990
everyone is human

7
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:12,190
When in crisis, we have to help each other

8
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:14,190
Which base are you from?

9
00:00:14,790 --> 00:00:16,590
Changxing Base Lin Qiang

10
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,180
So well said

11
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,780
What about the mutual help at your Changxing base?

12
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:25,020
We have few supplies

13
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,020
There's nothing I can do to help at the moment

14
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,020
That's not called helping each other.

15
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:31,020
That's us helping you unilaterally

16
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,420
But you have so many supplies

17
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:34,420
Help me, what's wrong?

18
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:37,060
Are our animals fighting a ghost battle?

19
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:38,060
How cold is the winter in March and April?

20
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:39,260
Do you know how hot it is outside now?

21
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:41,060
In our hot summer and cold winter sand, you are shrinking behind

22
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:43,260
Why do you ask us for Yurong with just your mouth?

23
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:46,060
There's no need to talk nonsense with them and throw people out, right?

24
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:47,060
Just say a few words to him
